{"section":{"id":"cet4-2025-06-set2-passage-2","examId":"cet4-2025-06-set2","title":"短文 2","kind":"短文","start":1054.67,"end":1166.75,"preview":"The New Year has come and gone, and many may have already forgotten what they had resolved to do on January 1st.","lines":[{"start":1054.67,"end":1062.91,"text":"The New Year has come and gone, and many may have already forgotten what they had resolved to do on January 1st."},{"start":1062.91,"end":1069.15,"text":"But if that resolution was to volunteer more, now is the best time to start."},{"start":1069.15,"end":1072.83,"text":"Volunteering can drop after the holiday season,"},{"start":1072.83,"end":1080.11,"text":"and by February, some organizations lack the volunteers they had in surplus just a month ago."},{"start":1080.11,"end":1085.54,"text":"According to one survey, only 26% of Americans volunteer,"},{"start":1085.54,"end":1090.59,"text":"despite reports that many Americans view volunteering as worthwhile."},{"start":1090.59,"end":1092.83,"text":"Why such a disconnect?"},{"start":1092.83,"end":1098.11,"text":"Most people cite time and conflicting work schedules as major barriers,"},{"start":1098.11,"end":1105.78,"text":"but employees and employers would actually benefit if companies made employee volunteering part of the job."},{"start":1105.78,"end":1111.55,"text":"Researchers have found donating our time and talent to others can lower blood pressure,"},{"start":1111.55,"end":1115.71,"text":"boost happiness and improve mental and physical health."},{"start":1115.71,"end":1122.19,"text":"Studies have also linked employee volunteer programs with more productive employees."},{"start":1122.19,"end":1126.02,"text":"With so much emphasis on employee wellness these days,"},{"start":1126.02,"end":1132.11,"text":"company volunteer programs could be the perfect 2025 resolution."},{"start":1132.11,"end":1136.67,"text":"But for volunteering to benefit employees and the workplace,"},{"start":1136.67,"end":1139.95,"text":"the entire organization needs to be involved."},{"start":1139.95,"end":1144.59,"text":"By allowing employees to donate their time during work hours,"},{"start":1144.59,"end":1150.83,"text":"the workplace becomes an outlet for personal fulfillment without affecting personal time."},{"start":1150.83,"end":1161.07,"text":"In one survey, 89% of employees perceived companies that sponsored volunteer activities as creating a better working environment,"},{"start":1161.07,"end":1166.75,"text":"and 75% said volunteering was critical to their well-being."}],"audio":"assets/audio/b8ae1b89d0c40762b8da9c8650f9e19290987ca876403ab2699af74f67b56f91.wav","audioOffset":1054.67},"tasks":[{"id":"0-0","text":"The New Year has come and gone, and many may have already forgotten what they had resolved to do on January 1st.","start":1054.67,"end":1062.91,"legacyTaskIds":["0-0"],"legacyTaskIndices":[0],"sentenceVisual":{"type":"时间","icon":"clock-3","image":"assets/images/30b924caea1fc35a941127374e5c6ed406a85c16d885540f91a39cb7a9115ebf.webp","alt":"新年计划被搁置的情境"},"chunks":[{"text":"The New Year has come and gone,","start":1054.67,"end":1057.18,"visual":{"type":"时间","icon":"clock-3","image":"assets/images/30b924caea1fc35a941127374e5c6ed406a85c16d885540f91a39cb7a9115ebf.webp","alt":"新年计划被搁置的情境"}},{"text":"and many may have already forgotten what they had resolved to do on January 1st.","start":1057.18,"end":1062.91,"visual":{"type":"数字","icon":"chart-column","image":"assets/images/4a1d6cf6dcb67d92c1f6cf50536e421e5615aee29177c338c6675b205cf4862e.webp","alt":"想起被放置的计划"}}],"variants":{"overview":[{"text":"The New Year has come and gone,","start":1054.67,"end":1057.18,"visual":{"type":"时间","icon":"clock-3","image":"assets/images/30b924caea1fc35a941127374e5c6ed406a85c16d885540f91a39cb7a9115ebf.webp","alt":"新年计划被搁置的情境"}},{"text":"and many may have already forgotten what they had resolved to do on January 1st.","start":1057.18,"end":1062.91,"visual":{"type":"数字","icon":"chart-column","image":"assets/images/4a